Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:03.76,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,21)}The Dictator Switch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:03.76,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\pos(243.2,447.8)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost this match 'cuz of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "Oh, really" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, I'll beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why only me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you suck in baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go out and practice so that this doesn't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But Giant's the problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man! I wish he'd just vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, wanna try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dictator Switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dictator Switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:01:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the switch that was developed for the dictators in the 22nd century.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The term "Dictator" refers to the leader who...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...take political decisions and influence the world just by themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The dictator gets rid of those who oppose him...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...as well as those who are an obstacle to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Making them non-existent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.05,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The bee is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,See? You can get rid of anyone who's getting in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.31,0:01:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's create a noble and just world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting rid of people is terrifying thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think over...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure! Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant is a terrible boy, sure. But I do feel bad about getting rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The leftover from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:01:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gone, Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He vanished, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a terrible thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you look so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I... Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's Giant, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Gouda Takeshi, a bully with fat belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember? He lives in our neighborhood!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Did such a boy exist, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher, please excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gouda-{\i1}kun{\i0}? I don't have such a student in our class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are a weird boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems when I get rid of people...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it becomes so that, they never existed to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost today's match 'cause of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gone, Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god! Suneo is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't use it again on anyone. I'll return it to Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost 'cuz of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up or else, I'll get rid of you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, go and do your homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I request you to please not make me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You want to return them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible, it's not a toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I get urge to use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon and you all, be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's eerily quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum! Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody on road!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All must be out playing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody besides me in this world! I've got rid of 'em all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I shouldn't have used it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:05:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no annoying mum or teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take what all I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's boring to play games all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back, Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling so lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when you get rid of people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:05:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:05:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, this gadget was developed to condemn dictatorship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's return them all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The loser's practicing baseball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure is a sucker, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun to play with annoying people!